T*
(Thank you. The tremendous growth in our business is being fueled by two fundamental trends ) Tj
T*
(that are driving global adoption of NVIDIA computing. First, the computing stack is undergoing) Tj
T*
( a reinvention, a platform shift from coding to machine learning, from executing code on CPUs ) Tj
T*
(to processing neural networks on GPUs. The $1 trillion installed base of traditional data ) Tj
T*
(center infrastructure is being rebuilt for Software 2.0, which applies machine learning to ) Tj
T*
(produce AI.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Second, the age of AI is in full steam. Generative AI is not just a new software capability ) Tj
T*
(but a new industry with AI factories manufacturing digital intelligence, a new industrial ) Tj
T*
(revolution that can create a multi-trillion-dollar AI industry. Demand for Hopper and ) Tj
T*
(anticipation for Blackwell, which is now in full production, are incredible for several ) Tj
T*
(reasons. There are more foundation model makers now than there were a year ago.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The computing scale of pretraining and post-training continues to grow exponentially. There ) Tj
T*
(are more AI-native start-ups than ever, and the number of successful inference services is ) Tj
T*
(rising. And with the introduction of ChatGPT o1, OpenAI o1, a new scaling law called test time) Tj
T*
( scaling has emerged. All of these consume a great deal of computing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI is transforming every industry, company, and country. Enterprises are adopting agentic AI ) Tj
T*
(to revolutionize workflows. Over time, AI coworkers will assist employees in performing their ) Tj
T*
(jobs faster and better. Investments in industrial robotics are surging due to breakthroughs in) Tj
T*
( physical AI, driving new training infrastructure demand as researchers train world foundation) Tj
T*
( models on petabytes of video and Omniverse synthetically generated data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The age of robotics is coming. Countries across the world recognize the fundamental AI trends ) Tj
T*
(we are seeing and have awakened to the importance of developing their national AI ) Tj
T*
(infrastructure. The age of AI is upon us, and it's large and diverse. NVIDIA's expertise, ) Tj
T*
(scale, and ability to deliver full stack and full infrastructure lets us serve the entire ) Tj
T*
(multitrillion-dollar AI and robotics opportunities ahead from every hyperscale cloud, ) Tj
T*
(enterprise private cloud to sovereign regional AI clouds, on-prem to industrial edge and ) Tj
T*
(robotics.) Tj
